    "title": {
      "bn": "কোনো শরিক সম্পত্তি খরিদ করিতে সম্মত হইলে আদালতের কর্মপদ্ধতি (ধারা 3)",
      "en": "Procedure When Shareholder Undertakes to Buy Property (Section 3)"
    },
    "originalText": "3. (1) If, in any case in which the Court is requested under the last foregoing section to direct a sale, any other shareholder applies for leave to buy at a valuation the share or shares of the party or parties asking for a sale, the Court shall order a valuation of the share or shares in such manner as it may think fit and offer to sell the same to such shareholder at the price so ascertained, and may give all necessary and proper directions in that behalf.\n(2) If two or more shareholders severally apply for leave to buy as provided in sub-section (1), the Court shall order a sale of the share or shares to the shareholder who offers to pay the highest price above the valuation made by the Court.\n(3) If no such shareholder is willing to buy such share or shares at the price so ascertained, the applicant or applicants shall be liable to pay all costs of or incident to the application or applications.",
    "originalLanguage": "en",
    "plainExplanation": {
      "bn": "ধারা ২ অনুযায়ী বিক্রয়ের আবেদন হলে অন্য কোনো শরিক যদি ওই অংশ কিনতে আগ্রহ প্রকাশ করে, তবে আদালত সম্পত্তির মূল্যায়ন করে আবেদনকারী শরিককে তা কেনার সুযোগ প্রদান করবেন।",
      "en": "Provides that if a sale is requested under Section 2, any other shareholder can apply to purchase the share of the party requesting sale; court orders official valuation and offers it to the applying shareholder."
    },
    "caution": {
      "bn": "বহিরাগত ব্যক্তির কাছে নিলাম বিক্রি রোধে বিদ্যমান শরিকগণ আদালত নির্ধারিত মূল্যে জমি কিনে নেওয়ার অগ্রক্রয়াধিকার পান।",
      "en": "Prevents property from being auctioned off to strangers by giving existing co-sharers the statutory preemptive option to buy out at court-determined value."
    },
