    "title": {
      "bn": "সংরক্ষিত মূল্য নির্ধারণ এবং অংশীদারগণ কর্তৃক নিলামে অংশগ্রহণ (ধারা 6)",
      "en": "Reserved Bidding and Bidding by Shareholders (Section 6)"
    },
    "originalText": "6. (1) Every sale under section 2 shall be subject to a reserved bidding, and the amount of such bidding shall be fixed by the Court in such manner as it may think fit and may be varied from time to time.\n(2) On any such sale any of the shareholders shall be at liberty to bid at the sale on such terms as to non-payment of deposit or as to setting off or accounting for the purchase-money or any part thereof instead of paying the same as to the Court may seem reasonable.\n(3) If two or more persons, of whom one is a shareholder in the property, respectively advance the same sum at any bidding at such sale, such bidding shall be deemed to be the bidding of the shareholder.",
    "originalLanguage": "en",
    "plainExplanation": {
      "bn": "ধারা ২ এর অধীন নিলামে সম্পত্তি বিক্রয়ের সময় আদালত একটি সর্বনিম্ন সংরক্ষিত মূল্য (Reserve price) ধার্য করবেন এবং শরিকগণও নিলামে ডাক দিতে পারবেন।",
      "en": "Requires the court to fix a reserve price in every partition sale under Section 2 to prevent distress sales, and allows existing shareholders to bid at the auction."
    },
    "caution": {
      "bn": "কম দামে সম্পত্তি হাতছাড়া রোধে আদালত অনুমোদিত সর্বনিম্ন সংরক্ষিত মূল্য নিশ্চিত করেন।",
      "en": "Prevents collusive low-price purchases by requiring independent certified court valuation as reserve price."
    },
